# the frozen surface, emitted by `swift-symbolgraph-extract` (a real toolchain
# tool — `swift package` has no `api` verb — over the built product modules,
# canonicalized to member-level symbols: public inits, methods, properties,
# enum cases, typealiases, macros. compiler-synthesized members are excluded.
